  "raw_label": "1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Crlp/4882/2020 on 2 November, 2020 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition No.4882 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "- This petition is filed under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973, seeking quash of F.I.R in Crime No. 296 of 2020 of Gangavaram Police Station, Chittoor District.",
    "arguments": "2. Heard learned counsel for the petitioners and the learned Additional Public Prosecutor. 3. The petitioners are A-1 to A-3 in Crime No.296 of 2020 of Gangavaram Police station. A case under Sections 188, 270, 273, 328 r/w 34 IPC, Sections 24(1) r/w 27 of the COTP Act, Section 3 of the Epidemic Diseases Act and under Section 59(i) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, was registered against them. 4. Learned counsel for the petitioners would submit that this is a covered matter and this Court, as per order, passed in Criminal Petition No.5421 of 2019 and batch, [LEAKAGE_MASK] about 55 F.I.Rs registered against the petitioners therein based on identical facts with similar allegations. Therefore, he would submit that the petitioners are similarly placed and they are also entitled for quash of the F.I.R. 5.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "2. Heard learned counsel for the petitioners and the learned Additional Public Prosecutor. 3. The petitioners are A-1 to A-3 in Crime No.296 of 2020 of Gangavaram Police station. A case under Sections 188, 270, 273, 328 r/w 34 IPC, Sections 24(1) r/w 27 of the COTP Act, Section 3 of the Epidemic Diseases Act and under Section 59(i) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, was registered against them. 4. Learned counsel for the petitioners would submit that this is a covered matter and this Court, as per order, passed in Criminal Petition No.5421 of 2019 and batch, [LEAKAGE_MASK] about 55 F.I.Rs registered against the petitioners therein based on identical facts with similar allegations. Therefore, he would submit that the petitioners are similarly placed and they are also entitled for quash of the F.I.R. 5.",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
  },
